    DUPREY "Знание того, {i}как{/i} и {i}когда{/i} использовать такие специальные приёмы, может стать разницей между жизнью и смертью."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:515
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_5681d705:

    # DUPREY "Besides that, our weapons, armor and skills are not our {i}only{/i} tools."
    DUPREY "Кроме того, наше оружие, доспехи и навыки — не {i}единственные{/i} инструменты."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:516
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_ebd0b574:

    # DUPREY "Elixirs, poisons, kick fucking sand in their eyes for all I care."
    DUPREY "Эликсиры, яды, пни бля песок им в глаза — мне всё равно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:517
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_33cac016:

    # DUPREY "The point is, you will each be expected to carry some basic supplies with you such as health vials."
    DUPREY "Суть в том, что каждый из вас должен будет носить с собой базовые припасы, такие как флаконы здоровья."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:518
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_dba0fa03:

    # DUPREY "I cannot count the amount of times I've seen men bought back from the edge of death thanks to these beauties."
    DUPREY "Я не могу сосчитать, сколько раз видел, как мужчин возвращали с края смерти благодаря этим красавицам."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:519
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_a34b076d:

    # "Captain Duprey dangled one of the elixirs in his hand."
    "Капитан Дюпре покачал в руке один из эликсиров."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:520
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_2f96e2f3:

    # DUPREY "Each of you will now spar, and upon injuring the other, use one of these."
    DUPREY "Теперь каждый из вас будет спарринговаться, и ранив другого, использует один из них."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:522
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_1b8bd188:

    # "Quartermaster Joakim moved down the line, handing each of us a small elixir."
    "Квартирмейстер Йоаким прошел по шеренге, вручая каждому из нас маленький эликсир."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:526
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_dc140759:

    # JOAKIM @ talk "Don't use it all at once, greenhorns!"
    JOAKIM @ talk "Не используйте всё сразу, салаги!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:528
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_fc8dd38d:

    # "Joakim laughed to himself as he retreated off to the sides, folding his arms and smiling as he waited for the spectacle to begin."
    "Йоаким самодовольно рассмеялся, отступая в сторону, скрестив руки и улыбаясь в ожидании начала зрелища."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:529
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_56e81d35:

    # DUPREY "Now, partner up for sparring."
    DUPREY "Теперь разбейтесь на пары для спарринга."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:530
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...НАЧАЛИ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:555
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1414ae63:

    # MARKUS "*Huff* *Huff* You sure have got some {i}special moves{/i}, [player_name!t]."
    MARKUS "*Гхаа* *Гхаа* У тебя точно есть {i}особые приёмы{/i}, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:556
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d58a2ad6:

    # "After Markus caught his breath, he asked:"
    "Переведя дух, Маркус спросил:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:557
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_7ade564e:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Care to give me another chance?"
    MARKUS @ smile "Не хочешь дать мне ещё один шанс?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:559
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d34ca5ec:

    # MARKUS "Come on, [player_name!t]."
    MARKUS "Давай же, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:560
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1a96582f:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Where's your mojo? Your battle-jive?"
    MARKUS @ smile "Куда делся твой задор? Твой боевой настрой?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:561
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_89a8d71d:

    # MC "My... *Huff* *Huff* ...What?"
    MC "Мой... *Гхаа* *Уфф* ...Что?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:562
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1215579d:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again, I felt as if I was swinging it against a training dummy!"
    MARKUS "Давай снова, я чувствую будто размахиваю им против тренировочного манекена!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:566
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_96a358be:

    # MARKUS "That's better now!"
    MARKUS "Так-то лучше!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:567
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_dbbfb15d:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Remember, 'special moves like these can be the difference between life and death'!"
    MARKUS @ smile "Помни, 'особые приёмы, подобные этим, могут стать разницей между жизнью и смертью'!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:568
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_1d019d6b:

    # "Markus smiled as he perfectly quoted Duprey."
    "Маркус улыбнулся, идеально процитировав Дюпре."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:569
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_4baaa790:

    # MC "Okay, I'll kick your ass now, {i}captain{/i}."
    MC "Ладно, сейчас я надеру тебе задницу, {i}капитан{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:570
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_397f9c31:

    # MARKUS "On guard!"
    MARKUS "К бою!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:575
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "Ладно."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:576
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_40b12a4d:

    # MARKUS "It was kinda cool though, wasn't it?"
    MARKUS "Но это было довольно круто, правда?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:577
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_eb54f1a5:

    # MC "Yeah, beats swinging it against these training dummies!"
    MC "Да, лучше чем размахивать им по этим тренировочным манекенам!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:585
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ba3a1381:

    # "For the remainder of the day, Duprey educated us on the nuances of using various special skills, tools and items in battle."
    "До конца дня Дюпре обучал нас тонкостям использования различных специальных навыков, инструментов и предметов в бою."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:586
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_d61d0b14:

    # "Exhausted, I didn't really get much of it: magic refraction scrolls, ensnarement crystals, Vulshan smoke bombs..."
    "Измотанный, я мало что понял: свитки магической рефракции, кристаллы захвата, вулшанские дымовые шашки..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:587
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_3a645881:

    # "Come dusk, Duprey concluded with showing us some advanced combat moves, I guess to somehow inspire us to master the art of combat."
    "С наступлением сумерек Дюпре завершил занятие, показав нам несколько продвинутых боевых приёмов, наверное чтобы как-то вдохновить нас на освоение искусства боя."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:592
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_ca79f8f3:

    # DUPREY "...So this is how you do the Waltzing Bazark strike."
    DUPREY "...Вот так выполняется удар «Вальсирующий Базарк»."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:593
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_7f316660:

    # "Duprey caught his breath after executing a rather spectacular combat move."
    "Дюпре перевёл дух после выполнения довольно зрелищного боевого приёма."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:594
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_55a1cf16:

    # "He scanned the crowd of recruits, totally exhausted from another training session, and I can promise I saw a hint of fatherly smile on his face."
    "Он окинул взглядом толпу новобранцев, совершенно измотанных очередной тренировкой, и клянусь, я увидел на его лице проблеск отеческой улыбки."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:595
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_56df01de:

    # DUPREY "Okay, you lot."
    DUPREY "Ладно, ребята."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:596
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_60e9fa7e:

    # DUPREY "Go and take some rest now."
    DUPREY "Идите и отдохните немного."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:602
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_c70200c9:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other in confusion:"
    "Мы с Маркусом с недоумением посмотрели друг на друга:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:603
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_b1a7928d:

    # MC "A Waltzing Bazark? I'm not even trying something like that."
    MC "Вальсирующий Базарк? Я даже не попытаюсь сделать что-то подобное."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:604
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1SkillsAndEnergyAndItems_repBattle_99873a35:

    # MARKUS "You'd be collecting me from all over the yard if I did..."
    MARKUS "Ты собирал бы меня по всему двору, если бы я это сделал..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:647
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a3accbf:

    # REGINA "...[player_name!t]."
    REGINA "...[player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:648
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_7199e905:

    # REGINA "Wake up, [player_name!t]."
    REGINA "Проснись, [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:651
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_2a66cc92:

    # "As my eyes slowly peeled open, a dark, raven haired blob was stood, lurched over the side of my bed."
    "Когда мои глаза медленно открылись, над краем моей кровати нависала тёмная, черноволосая фигура."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:653
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_c40f7ba2:

    # "My vision became clearer: there I saw, clear as day, [regina_ref!t] crouched over and smiling towards me."
    "Моё зрение прояснилось: я увидел, ясно как день, [regina_ref!t], присевшую и улыбающуюся мне."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:654
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_0bbec91f:

    # MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"
    MC @ surprised "[regina_ref_cap!t]?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:655
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3fe750ff:

    # "[regina_ref_cap!t] placed her finger over her lip and motioned for me to be silent."
    "[regina_ref_cap!t] приложила палец к губам и жестом попросила меня быть тише."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:655
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_87f8b481:

    # "{i}Was this some kind of a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}Это был какой-то сон?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:656
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_9ce974a4:

    # "She leaned in close to whisper."
    "Она наклонилась ближе, чтобы прошептать."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:657
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_32cf642b:

    # REGINA @ smile "I've bought you some things, dear."
    REGINA @ smile "Я купила тебе кое-что, милый."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:658
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_6f52509f:

    # REGINA @ talk "{i}Just a little something between the two of us...{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "{i}Просто маленький секрет между нами двумя...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:659
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caa43851:

    # MC @ surprised "How ... How did you even get in here?"
    MC @ surprised "Как... Как ты вообще сюда попала?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:660
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_257c75a7:

    # REGINA @ talk "Don't worry about that now, dear."
    REGINA @ talk "Не беспокойся об этом сейчас, милый."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:661
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_eb2e578c:

    # REGINA @ talk "I just wanted to see you."
    REGINA @ talk "Я просто хотела тебя увидеть."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:662
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_fb531ee6:

    # MC @ talk "But-"
    MC @ talk "Но-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:663
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24a60a73:

    # "As her hand gently caressed my cheek, I began to feel myself drifting back to the darkness once again."
    "Когда её рука нежно коснулась моей щеки, я снова начал погружаться в темноту."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:665
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4ff52e4f:

    # "{i}Perhaps, this really was a dream?{/i}"
    "{i}Возможно, это и правда был сон?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:666
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_ccaef93c:

    # REGINA @ talk "Shhh... {i}Sleep, dear.{/i}"
    REGINA @ talk "Тссс... {i}Спи, дорогой.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:667
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_898758b8:

    # REGINA "{i}I'll always be here for you...{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}Я всегда буду рядом с тобой...{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:668
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_3b1abd21:

    # REGINA "{i}...no matter what.{/i}"
    REGINA "{i}...что бы ни случилось.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:692
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_caba15b5:

    # "Springing upright in my bed, soaked in sweat, I looked around as people prepared themselves for another day of training."
    "Я резко сел на кровать, весь в поту, оглядываясь как люди готовятся к очередному дню тренировок."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:696
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_4f0b95e9:

    # MARKUS "[player_name!t]? Are you alright?"
    MARKUS "[player_name!t]? Ты в порядке?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:696
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_24f0136a:

    # MC @ scared "I ... I think so."
    MC @ scared "Я... Думаю да."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:697
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_328b83d2:

    # MARKUS "Bad dreams?"
    MARKUS "Плохие сны?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:699
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_b260c7ad:

    # MC @ scared "...I'm not sure what it was."
    MC @ scared "...Я не уверен, что это было."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:700
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5d45ce3:

    # MARKUS @ shock "Well, you look like you've seen a ghost!"
    MARKUS @ shock "Ну, ты выглядишь будто видел призрака!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:701
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d5193f8a:

    # "Somehow, a ghost felt more explainable than what I saw last night..."
    "Как-то призрак казался более объяснимым, чем то что я видел прошлой ночью..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:702
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_247c26f4:

    # MARKUS "Come, I'm sure a few whacks from a training sword will take your mind off whatever it was!"
    MARKUS "Пойдём, уверен несколько ударов тренировочным мечом отвлекут тебя от того, что бы это ни было!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:705
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_a8954217:

    # "As Markus headed out of the barracks towards the training yard, I shook my head, pushing the strange dream aside."
    "Пока Маркус выходил из казармы на тренировочный двор, я покачал головой, отгоняя странный сон."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:707
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_83da7088:

    # "Opening my chest to grab my uniform, I noticed immediately the strangely placed bottle of red wine that wasn't there before..."
    "Открывая свой сундук, чтобы взять униформу, я сразу заметил странно поставленную бутылку красного вина, которой раньше не было..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:709
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_01b21009:

    # MC @ scared "(It... It was a dream!)"
    MC @ scared "(Это... Это был сон!)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:712
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training1NightEvent_d62002c2:

    # MC @ think "(...Right?)"
    MC @ think "(...Ведь так?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:724
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f1834407:

    # DUPREY "...So, having being around a little, what do you lot think matters the most in battle?"
    DUPREY "...Итак, раз уж вы тут не новички, как вы думаете, что самое важное в бою?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:725
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_84edc41c:

    # "We looked at each other puzzled."
    "Мы озадаченно переглянулись."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:727
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_cef8185e:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Strength?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Сила?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:728
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6cf01769:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Our gear!{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Наша экипировка!{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:729
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_5b70b478:

    # "Some of us were throwing more words out there, until..."
    "Кто-то из нас предлагал другие варианты, пока..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:730
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_59efef91:

    # RECRUITS "{i}Being like... a single force?{/i}"
    RECRUITS "{i}Быть как... единая сила?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:731
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_60c375e0:

    # "I swear I saw a hint of suprise on Duprey's face:"
    "Клянусь, я увидел проблеск удивления на лице Дюпре:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:732
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_a52d9426:

    # DUPREY @ laugh "Right on, lad!"
    DUPREY @ laugh "Верно, парень!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:733
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ae81de48:

    # "Silence covered our ranks, as we have began to realize what today's lesson was about."
    "Тишина окутала наши ряды, когда мы начали осознавать, о чём сегодняшний урок."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:734
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_c6bbed4f:

    # "Duprey smiled for a moment as he continued:"
    "Дюпре на мгновение улыбнулся и продолжил:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:735
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_f6068bdd:

    # DUPREY "Teamwork, lads."
    DUPREY "Командная работа, парни."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:736
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2c171579:

    # DUPREY "Confidence in a soldier to your left and a soldier to your right, {i}this{/i} is the driving force behind any worthy army."
    DUPREY "Уверенность в солдате слева и солдате справа, {i}это{/i} и есть движущая сила любой достойной армии."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:737
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_479fffc2:

    # "Duprey began pointing at recruits from the crowd:"
    "Дюпре начал указывать на новобранцев из толпы:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:738
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_54599814:

    # DUPREY "You can have the best gear in all Alderay!"
    DUPREY "У вас может быть лучшее снаряжение во всём Алдерее!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:739
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fae39187:

    # DUPREY "And you can be an expert at handling your weapon of choice,"
    DUPREY "И вы можете быть экспертом в обращении с оружием по вашему выбору,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:740
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_812a5810:

    # DUPREY "While your bag of dirty tricks can grow as large as to become a caravan,"
    DUPREY "Хотя твой мешок грязных трюков может разрастись до размеров целого каравана,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:741
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_671d40a2:

    # "Some recruits laughed as Duprey continued, ever more serious:"
    "Некоторые новобранцы рассмеялись, пока Дюпре продолжал, становясь всё серьёзнее:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:742
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_2ff1717a:

    # DUPREY "But if you don't have a warrior, a true battle brother you are dead sure in at your side,"
    DUPREY "Но если у тебя нет воина, настоящего брата по оружию, в котором ты уверен как в самом себе,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:743
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_ff502967:

    # DUPREY "One who would stand with you no matter what is coming at you..."
    DUPREY "Того, кто будет стоять с тобой плечом к плечу, что бы ни обрушилось на вас..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:744
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_95d64e38:

    # "Duprey's expression turned pale for a moment, as if his mind's eye erupted with memories."
    "Выражение лица Дюпре на мгновение побледнело, словно его мысленный взор вспыхнул воспоминаниями."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:745
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_fa17f4b8:

    # DUPREY "You {i}will be{/i} obliterated."
    DUPREY "Тебя {i}сотрут в пыль{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:746
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_828b281f:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other and nodded stoically, but Duprey's usual commanding tone snapped us out of it quick:"
    "Мы с Маркусом переглянулись и кивнули стоически, но привычный командный тон Дюпре быстро вывел нас из этого состояния:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:747
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_b5b6ec4e:

    # DUPREY "None of us would want that to happen, right you maggots?!"
    DUPREY "Никто из нас не хотел бы, чтобы это случилось, верно, червяки?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:749
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_41a3cf71:

    # DUPREY "Today, you will spar in teams of two!"
    DUPREY "Сегодня вы будете спарринговаться в командах по двое!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:750
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_dfb15ac9:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, and get to it!"
    DUPREY "Объединяйтесь в пары и за дело!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:751
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_6e24ff53:

    # DUPREY "...BEGIN!"
    DUPREY "...НАЧАЛИ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:775
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_22336bc1:

    # MARKUS "Phew... You guys kicked our ass!"
    MARKUS "Фух... Вы ребята, надрали нам задницы!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:776
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d5403c39:

    # MARKUS "Let's go again now!"
    MARKUS "Давайте снова!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:777
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_d4066694:

    # MARKUS "I swear you won't get us this time!"
    MARKUS "Клянусь, в этот раз вы нас не возьмёте!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:779
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4303ca27:

    # "Markus and his teammate both looked at us two."
    "Маркус и его напарник оба посмотрели на нас двоих."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:780
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_4c68b6fe:

    # MARKUS "Come on guys, remember what Duprey said!"
    MARKUS "Давайте ребята, помните что сказал Дюпре!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:781
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_072ed379:

    # MARKUS "Be a single force!"
    MARKUS "Будьте единой силой!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:782
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_7e6c58ca:

    # "His teammate interrupted:"
    "Его напарник прервал:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:784
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_c87c6273:

    # RECRUIT "Actually... it was me who said it..."
    RECRUIT "Вообще-то... это я это сказал..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:785
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_76d4b651:

    # "I let out a laugh which echoed painfully all over my body."
    "Я издал смешок, который болезненно отозвался по всему моему телу."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:786
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_33a51547:

    # MARKUS "... Whatever! Come on, let's go for another round!"
    MARKUS "... Неважно! Давай, ещё один раунд!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:789
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_2af51c90:

    # MARKUS "That's what I like to hear!"
    MARKUS "Вот это я люблю слышать!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:790
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_102beb74:

    # MARKUS @ smile "Let's see if our 'army' defeats yours this time!"
    MARKUS @ smile "Посмотрим, победит ли наша 'армия' твою на этот раз!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:794
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_82ab4d75:

    # MARKUS "Okay then."
    MARKUS "Ладно, тогда."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:795
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1506ca74:

    # MARKUS "I've sprained my ankle anyways..."
    MARKUS "Я всё равно подвернул лодыжку..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:798
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_3c091867:

    # "The rest of the day we have spent learning more nuances about working together as a combat unit."
    "Остаток дня мы провели, изучая больше нюансов совместной работы как боевое подразделение."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:799
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_1da7d2b2:

    # "As we have come to realize the importance of teamwork in practice, Duprey's initial statement of it being the crucial aspect of warfare became clear as day."
    "Как мы осознали на практике, важность командной работы, первоначальное заявление Дюпре о том, что это ключевой аспект войны, теперь стало ясно как день."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:800
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_73c0dac8:

    # "We had to {i}become{/i} the Second Scouts Division."
    "Нам пришлось {i}стать{/i} Вторым Разведывательным Дивизионом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:805
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5d262372:

    # DUPREY "...So, that will be it for today, Scouts."
    DUPREY "...Итак, на сегодня это всё, Разведчики."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:806
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_b8c44b07:

    # DUPREY "And one more thing..."
    DUPREY "И ещё кое-что..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:807
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_f2c412ef:

    # DUPREY "We can't be training in this cage forever,"
    DUPREY "Мы не можем вечно тренироваться в этой клетке,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:808
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_fc3f4089:

    # "Duprey waved at the walls,"
    "Дюпре махнул рукой на стены,"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:809
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5bc59c1b:

    # DUPREY "But before we begin any real training maneuvers, I need to see just how much you lot had learned since you've got here."
    DUPREY "Но прежде чем мы начнём настоящие тренировочные манёвры, мне нужно увидеть, как много вы ребята усвоили с тех пор, как попали сюда."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:810
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_37c4720a:

    # DUPREY "Hit that bunk hard for there will be a test tomorrow!"
    DUPREY "Бейте по койкам, потому что завтра будет тест!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:811
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Свободны!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:816
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_70c270b5:

    # "Me and Markus exchanged looks."
    "Мы с Маркусом обменялись взглядами."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:817
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_5dbd6a38:

    # MARKUS "A test, huh?"
    MARKUS "Тест, значит?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:818
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2Teamwork_repBattle_0da95cfe:

    # MC "Whatever it is, let's go get some sleep."
    MC "Что бы это ни было, давай пойдём поспим."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:835
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6d3b7e65:

    # "In the dead of night, I was restless."
    "Глубокой ночью я не мог уснуть."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:840
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8c266e01:

    # "Opening my eyes, I sat-upright in my bunk and looked around."
    "Открыв глаза, я сел на своей койке и осмотрелся."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:842
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccd5a8ea:

    # "Everyone around me was deep in sleep still, including Markus."
    "Все вокруг всё ещё крепко спали, включая Маркуса."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:843
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_03bec688:

    # "I sighed, rubbing my forehead as I climbed out of bed."
    "Я вздохнул, потирая лоб, и выбрался из постели."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:844
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b9564fe7:

    # "{i}Just a short walk around the fort grounds{/i} I told myself..."
    "{i}Просто короткая прогулка по территории форта{/i}, — сказал я себе..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:845
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af74cbd2:

    # "I'll be back before anyone even realizes I'm gone."
    "Я вернусь, прежде чем кто-либо вообще поймёт, что меня нет."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:852
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59eaf8b8:

    # "As the cold night air hit my lungs, I thought about heading back inside before I heard Captain Duprey's voice."
    "Когда холодный ночной воздух ударил мне в лёгкие, я подумал о том, чтобы вернуться внутрь, но тут услышал голос Капитана Дюпре."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:853
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4acebe14:

    # DUPREY "Thank you all for coming..."
    DUPREY "Спасибо всем, что пришли..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:854
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_14ad4098:

    # MC "(Hm? What's going on?)"
    MC "(Хм? Что происходит?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:855
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b6dd5166:

    # MC "(It sounds like it's coming from the training yard.)"
    MC "(Похоже, звуки доносятся с тренировочного плаца.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:866
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f159a15b:

    # "Peering around the corner, Captain Duprey stood alongside Borras as two figures joined them."
    "Заглянув за угол, я увидел капитана Дюпре рядом с Боррасом, к ним присоединились две фигуры."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:869
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_683fa502:

    # "The first, a beautiful, yet stern and cold looking blonde in a hooded robe."
    "Первая — красивая, но суровая и холодная блондинка в капюшоне."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:870
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_39c09853:

    # "The other, a man of larger stature who I had not seen either."
    "Другой, мужчина более крупного телосложения, которого я тоже не видел."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:872
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c3816f8a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Well, out with it."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Ну, говори уже."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:873
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_829708c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Why did you ask us to meet here and not in my office?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Почему ты попросил нас встретиться здесь, а не в моем кабинете?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:874
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e5dab11:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "I'm freezing my tits off out here you know."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Я тут груди отмораживаю, если ты не в курсе."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:875
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5d90ff9:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "I could keep them warm for you if you wish."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Я мог бы согреть их для тебя, если хочешь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:877
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8cce2042:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Lay a hand on me and you will never {i}touch{/i} anything again."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Положи на меня руку, и ты больше никогда ни к чему не {i}прикоснешься{/i}."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:878
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ccb33939:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Feisty as always."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Все такая же вспыльчивая."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:879
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7d3baf97:

    # DUPREY "I'm sorry for summoning you both at such a late hour."
    DUPREY "Простите, что вызвал вас обоих в такой поздний час."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:880
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_438696b5:

    # DUPREY "I couldn't risk the potential of spies listening in on what I had to say now."
    DUPREY "Я не мог рисковать возможностью, что шпионы подслушают то, что я должен сказать сейчас."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:881
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_15a278d5:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "And out here is safer than my office how?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "И почему здесь безопаснее, чем в моем кабинете?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:882
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ea753ae:

    # DUPREY "{i}*Sigh*{/i} I recently conducted a private search across the whole fortress with only my most trusted men."
    DUPREY "{i}*Вздох*{/i} Я недавно провёл тайный обыск по всей крепости только с самыми доверенными людьми."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:883
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_627d96fc:

    # DUPREY "I found echo crystals everywhere... including your office."
    DUPREY "Я нашёл эхо-кристаллы повсюду... включая твой кабинет."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:884
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e306341:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You..."
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "Ты..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:885
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2b146927:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Echo crystals?{/i}"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "{i}Эхо-кристаллы?{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:886
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7cc2c81:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "That can't be right, I have my office checked, I-"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Этого не может быть, мой кабинет проверяли, я-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:887
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7233b5ac:

    # "Duprey nodded, holding up a small, glowing yellow crystal that he tossed to the robed blonde."
    "Дюпре кивнул, держа в руке маленький светящийся жёлтый кристалл, который он бросил блондинке в мантии."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:889
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b21cd245:

    # DUPREY "I'm afraid it's so."
    DUPREY "Боюсь, это так."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:890
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3e335085:

    # "The woman inspected the crystal and gritted her teeth in anger at it."
    "Женщина осмотрела кристалл и скрипнула зубами от ярости."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:891
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1faccc03:

    # DUPREY "It seems our great {i}'emperor'{/i} does not hold our loyalty in high regard."
    DUPREY "Похоже, наш великий {i}'император'{/i} не высоко ценит нашу преданность."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:892
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d6956b86:

    # "The larger man chuckled."
    "Крупный мужчина усмехнулся."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:893
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cac71787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "After everything that's happened, can you truly blame him?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "После всего, что произошло, можно ли его по-настоящему винить?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:894
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e7113e66:

    # "The blonde woman seemed more frustrated than the others, coiling her one hand into a tight fist."
    "Блондинка казалась более раздражённой, чем остальные, сжав одну руку в тугой кулак."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:895
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_897edc9c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Come now, this is all part of the game."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Ну-ну, это всё часть игры."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:896
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_da595d25:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Yes, I... I am aware."
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Да, я... я в курсе."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:897
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_aed55156:

    # DUPREY "The guards only patrol this area periodically, and it's the one place no echo crystals turned up during the search."
    DUPREY "Охрана патрулирует эту зону только периодически, и это единственное место, где во время обыска не нашли эхо-кристаллов."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:898
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cf9fe043:

    # DUPREY "I suppose they figured the chatter of grunts wasn't worth hearing."
    DUPREY "Полагаю, они решили, что болтовня рядовых не стоит того, чтобы её слушать."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:899
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_4b3ecc3c:

    # DUPREY "Which is exactly why we're meeting here now."
    DUPREY "Именно поэтому мы сейчас встречаемся здесь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:900
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97cd58fc:

    # "The larger man raised his brow."
    "Более крупный мужчина приподнял бровь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:901
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c4efb787:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "That's all well and good... But why exactly is {i}he{/i} here?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "Всё это хорошо... Но почему именно {i}он{/i} здесь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:902
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ecda2cd:

    # "The man pointed towards Borras, whose brow furrowed at the comment."
    "Мужчина указал на Борраса, чья бровь нахмурилась от этого комментария."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:903
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a377fbed:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "He's hardly fit to stand here with the rest of us."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ angry "Он едва ли достоин стоять здесь с остальными из нас."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:904
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_000b3a6c:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras will be replacing me for command of the Second Scouts Division, within a year or so."
    DUPREY "Офицер Боррас заменит меня на посту командира Второго Разведывательного Дивизиона, примерно через год или около того."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:905
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ade1214e:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ shock "You're leaving?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ shock "Ты уходишь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:906
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2897e861:

    # DUPREY "My time is nearly up... I'm slowing down too much."
    DUPREY "Моё время почти вышло... Я слишком замедлился."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:907
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_1d99c218:

    # "While the blonde seemed saddened to hear this, the larger man opened his palm upwards towards the sky."
    "В то время как блондинка, казалось опечалилась услышав это, более крупный мужчина раскрыл ладонь вверх к небу."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:908
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c246e162:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I hope you didn't drag us out here to discuss your future retirement plans you old fuck."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Надеюсь, ты не вытащил нас сюда, чтобы обсудить свои будущие планы на пенсию, старый хрен."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:909
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dd633049:

    # DUPREY "Hmph..."
    DUPREY "Хмпх..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:910
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_07d9c1a1:

    # DUPREY "Officer Borras, hand them the reports."
    DUPREY "Офицер Боррас, передай им отчёты."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:911
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_85fc15c1:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Yes Captain."
    BORRAS @ talk "Да, капитан."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:913
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a550ea4e:

    # "Borras handed over a few sheets of paper towards the robed pair."
    "Боррас передал несколько листов бумаги паре в мантиях."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:914
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e077ed9f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "What's this?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Что это?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:915
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbb0024b:

    # DUPREY "A report that Alcott attempted to suppress."
    DUPREY "Отчёт, который Алкотт пытался скрыть."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:916
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0873ff5f:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "About?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "О чём?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:917
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dfb5dc62:

    # DUPREY "...{i}Zanarak has returned.{/i}"
    DUPREY "...{i}Занарак вернулся.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:918
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_dbf78d30:

    # "A great unease filled the air and I felt a shiver tingle it's way up my spine."
    "В воздухе повисла огромная тревога, и я почувствовал, как дрожь пробежала по спине."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:919
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_506be64d:

    # "The name crawled and dragged its way horribly across my thoughts."
    "Это имя мерзко ползло и тащилось по моим мыслям."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:920
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_04766be0:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "There hasn't been a sighting in years."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ happy "Его не видели уже много лет."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:921
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ad6d35ce:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Wasn't it reported that the beast was hunted down by the Inquisition?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Разве не сообщалось, что чудовище было выслежено Инквизицией?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:922
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_cbbee22b:

    # DUPREY "A lie told to ease panicking nobles."
    DUPREY "Ложь, рассказанная чтобы успокоить паникующих дворян."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:923
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_38a43a2d:

    # DUPREY "While it is true the beast has vanished for the last few years, this cannot be ignored."
    DUPREY "Хотя зверь действительно исчезал последние несколько лет, это нельзя игнорировать."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:924
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_78892759:

    # DUPREY "The beast's return... changes things."
    DUPREY "Возвращение зверя... меняет всё."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:925
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_7a86413b:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "A specter, a boogeyman..."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Призрак, бабай..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:926
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a777b442:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "There are dozens of Demorai over the years that people have wrongly mistaken for being Zanarak."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "За эти годы были десятки Деморай, которых люди ошибочно принимали за Занарака."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:927
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_086782c0:

    # "The man belligerently crossed his arms."
    "Мужчина вызывающе скрестил руки."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:928
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ee8e9a7d:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...I'm not even convinced this Zanarak was real to begin with."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...Я даже не уверен, что этот Занарак вообще был реальным."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:929
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_8ebb0762:

    # DUPREY "Oh... He's as real as you and I alright."
    DUPREY "Оо... Он так же реален, как ты и я."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:930
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ba99ad23:

    # DUPREY "Make no mistake about that."
    DUPREY "Не сомневайся в этом."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:931
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6b72d9c8:

    # DUPREY "...And when he comes, all of us need to be prepared."
    DUPREY "...И когда он придёт, мы все должны быть готовы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:932
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2bce0fc0:

    # DUPREY "With, {i}or without{/i} the Emperors knowledge."
    DUPREY "С ведома, {i}или без{/i} ведома Императора."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:933
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3cdbebf1:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "What are you saying, Duprey?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Что ты хочешь сказать, Дюпре?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:934
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59e5864b:

    # DUPREY "I'm saying, Alcott can bury his head in the fucking sand and play politics all he wants to try and appease wet-fart nobles."
    DUPREY "Я говорю, Алкотт может зарывать голову в гребаный песок и играть в политику сколько угодно, пытаясь ублажить благородных с мокрыми подштанниками."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:935
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_fcc3f2c9:

    # DUPREY "{i}But we need to be prepared for what's to come whether this knowledge is made public or not.{/i}"
    DUPREY "{i}Но мы должны быть готовы к тому, что грядёт, независимо от того станут эти сведения достоянием общественности или нет.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:936
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_18e7a24a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Duprey... You need to tread carefully with this."
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Дюпре... Тебе нужно быть осторожнее с этим."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:937
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_5b839082:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ talk "How exactly did {i}you{/i} manage to get your hands on this report anyway?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ talk "Как именно {i}тебе{/i} удалось раздобыть этот отчёт?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:938
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a2aca459:

    # BORRAS @ talk "By pure chance."
    BORRAS @ talk "Чистой случайностью."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:939
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a174e1ce:

    # "Borras stepped forward."
    "Боррас сделал шаг вперёд."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:940
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_913c0dc3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "I was on a normal patrol through the Valley of Death when I stumbled upon a small, slaughtered convoy."
    BORRAS @ talk "Я был в обычном патруле по Долине Смерти, когда наткнулся на небольшой разгромленный конвой."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:941
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_787647a3:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Amongst their dead was an Inquisitor, who with his dying breath handed me this report."
    BORRAS @ talk "Среди их мёртвых был Инквизитор, который с последним дыханием вручил мне этот отчёт."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:942
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a7d9dd7a:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "The dying words of a delusional Inquisitor on death's door mean very little."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Предсмертные слова бредящего на пороге смерти Инквизитора мало что значат."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:943
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_46254da9:

    # BORRAS @ talk "There was other reports..."
    BORRAS @ talk "Были и другие отчёты..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:944
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f3335e6e:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "What?"
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ think "Что?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:945
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_825a1215:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Suppressed as soon as they arrive, but more and more scant reports from our men on the fringes have reported seeing it."
    BORRAS @ talk "Подавляются сразу по прибытии, но всё больше скудных донесений от наших людей на окраинах сообщают, что они это видели."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:946
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0d7eadc0:

    # "Both the woman and man were troubled the more they heard."
    "И женщину, и мужчину всё больше тревожило то, что они слышали."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:947
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f2428e23:

    # DUPREY "From now on, the three of us need to work closer together."
    DUPREY "Отныне нам троим нужно работать теснее."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:948
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a899d6c2:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ angry "The city guard is barely holding on as it is, what exactly do you expect me to do?"
    NYX_BLONDE @ angry "Городская стража и так едва держится, чего именно ты от меня ожидаешь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:949
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b10a0545:

    # DUPREY "Whatever you have to do when the time comes."
    DUPREY "Что бы тебе ни пришлось делать, когда придёт время."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:950
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6afc1660:

    # "Duprey seemed to be working himself up into a feverish plea."
    "Дюпре, казалось подбадривал себя лихорадочной мольбой."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:951
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_104f25e1:

    # DUPREY "These little camps everyone's set up is leaving us more divided than ever, it'll be the ruin of us all!"
    DUPREY "Эти маленькие лагеря, которые все устроили, оставляют нас более разобщёнными чем когда-либо, это будет гибелью для всех нас!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:952
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2e21a987:

    # DUPREY "We need to unite and pledge to each other that when the time comes-"
    DUPREY "Нам нужно объединиться и поклясться друг другу, что когда придёт время—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:953
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_59c8c819:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "I promise you nothing, Duprey."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "Я ничего тебе не обещаю, Дюпре."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:954
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e629b28d:

    # "The broad man's words cut through Duprey's like ice."
    "Слова широкоплечего мужчины прорезали речь Дюпре словно лёд."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:955
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_b4c2c3b7:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...But I shall look into these reports myself."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "...Но я изучу эти доклады лично."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:956
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ebf4078c:

    # LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "And depending on what I find, {i}perhaps{/i} there will be more to discuss."
    LUKKAN_THE_BIG_GUY @ talk "И в зависимости от того, что я найду, {i}возможно{/i}, нам будет что обсудить."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:957
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e102cb4c:

    # "The broad man turned to leave, and as he did so, Captain Duprey looked towards the woman."
    "Широкоплечий мужчина повернулся чтобы уйти, и в этот момент капитан Дюпре взглянул на женщину."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:958
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6ff2487b:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "... I don't know, Duprey, this just maybe isn't the right time."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "... Не знаю, Дюпре, возможно сейчас просто неподходящее время."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:959
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_ece5bef6:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "The more we unite our forces, the more we paint ourselves a target for the other factions."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "Чем больше мы объединяем наши силы, тем заметнее становимся мишенью для других фракций."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:960
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f5cdc275:

    # DUPREY "... I don't care about the factions."
    DUPREY "... Меня не волнуют фракции."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:961
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_361df80b:

    # DUPREY "I don't care about the politics of the damn thing."
    DUPREY "Меня не волнует политика этой чёртовой ситуации."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:962
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_538b8cf8:

    # DUPREY "What does any of that matter if there's no one left in the end?"
    DUPREY "Какое это имеет значение, если в конце концов никого не останется?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:963
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_c7e9daac:

    # DUPREY "Newheart is gone... There's no one left to save us but ourselves now."
    DUPREY "Ньюхарт исчез... Нам больше не на кого рассчитывать, кроме самих себя."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:964
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0e94a49a:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Goodnight, Duprey."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "...Спокойной ночи, Дюпре."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:965
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_2d5676a4:

    # NYX_BLONDE @ sad "I hope you're wrong about all this... I really do."
    NYX_BLONDE @ sad "Надеюсь, ты ошибаешься насчёт всего этого... Искренне надеюсь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:966
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_3bff260d:

    # "The woman turned to leave and join the broad man, leaving Captain Duprey to stand beside Officer Borras alone."
    "Женщина повернулась, чтобы уйти и присоединиться к крупному мужчине, оставив капитана Дюпре стоять рядом с офицером Боррасом в одиночестве."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:970
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_9b060e61:

    # "As the two figures passed me by, I hid myself behind a barrel and waited for them to be out of sight."
    "Когда две фигуры прошли мимо меня, я спрятался за бочкой и подождал, пока они скроются из виду."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:973
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d553e83d:

    # BORRAS @ talk "Captain..."
    BORRAS @ talk "Капитан..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:974
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_eba06326:

    # DUPREY "Return to your quarters, Borras."
    DUPREY "Возвращайся в свои покои, Боррас."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:975
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_6fa2cda7:

    # DUPREY "Speak nothing of what has been said tonight."
    DUPREY "Ни слова о том, что было сказано сегодня ночью."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:976
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_f9c712a9:

    # BORRAS @ sad "But-"
    BORRAS @ sad "Но-"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:977
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_87e8ae86:

    # DUPREY "I'm tired Borras... So very tired."
    DUPREY "Я устал, Боррас... Очень устал."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:978
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_0ae2d5a5:

    # DUPREY "The next battle can wait for another day."
    DUPREY "Следующая битва может подождать до другого дня."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:981
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_a5187100:

    # "Slowly, I watched as Captain Duprey slumped towards the barracks, likely back to his quarters."
    "Медленно я наблюдал, как капитан Дюпре поплёлся к казармам, вероятно обратно в свои покои."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:983
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_e034c8e5:

    # MC "(Zanarak... Can it really be?)"
    MC "(Занарак... Неужели это правда?)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:985
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97d93231:

    # "I shook my head, pushing the terrible thoughts away."
    "Я покачал головой, отгоняя ужасные мысли."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:986
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_d2897e6b:

    # MC "(I need to return to my bed, before someone sees me.)"
    MC "(Мне нужно вернуться на койку, пока кто-нибудь меня не увидел.)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:992
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_97284131:

    # "As I laid down onto the bed, dark, terrible thoughts and dreams returned."
    "Когда я лёг на кровать, тёмные ужасные мысли и сны вернулись."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:993
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training2NightEvent_af180033:

    # "Returned to torment me for the rest of the night."
    "Вернулись, чтобы мучить меня до конца ночи."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1008
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_eb24fb27:

    # DUPREY "Alright maggots, today I will see whether you lot have made any progress or had you just wasted my time!"
    DUPREY "Так, червяки, сегодня я посмотрю есть ли у вас хоть какой-то прогресс, или вы просто потратили моё время впустую!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1009
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_884243ea:

    # DUPREY "We will start with duels first!"
    DUPREY "Начнём с дуэлей!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1010
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_62189e19:

    # DUPREY "Partner up, grab yourself a healing vial, and fight as if your life depended on it!"
    DUPREY "Разбейтесь на пары, возьмите себе флакон с лечебным зельем и сражайтесь так, будто от этого зависит ваша жизнь!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1015
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_761342c6:

    # MC "Shit got real, huh?"
    MC "Дело приняло серьёзный оборот, да?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1016
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_67044540:

    # "Markus was certainly not going to fool around this time."
    "Маркус точно не собирался на этот раз валять дурака."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1018
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_d92306b7:

    # MARKUS @ angry "Come on, [player_name!t], let's do this!"
    MARKUS @ angry "Давай, [player_name!t], сделаем это!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1018
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_bc95234e:

    # MC @ angry "Alright, bring it on then!"
    MC @ angry "Ладно, давай тогда!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1052
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_1263e952:

    # "Ouch."
    "Ай."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1053
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_c58b41a1:

    # "Darkness."
    "Тьма."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1054
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8f6cd72d:

    # "Then, dim light telling shapes apart."
    "Затем, тусклый свет, различающий очертания."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1055
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_ce93bfa4:

    # "A vision."
    "Видение."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1056
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_a05d37f2:

    # "A vision of Alderay under demonic onslaught."
    "Видение Алдерея под демоническим натиском."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1057
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_f32b1941:

    # "Of me, defending it's people."
    "Обо мне, защищающем его народ."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1058
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_27cd56c1:

    # "Uniting them under my banners."
    "Объединяющем их под моими знамёнами."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1059
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_63b84b20:

    # "Power."
    "Сила."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1060
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_008f17f9:

    # "Wealth."
    "Богатство."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1061
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d7eea514:

    # "Women..."
    "Женщины..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1062
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_b6ce6190:

    # "However, there is something else."
    "Однако, есть что-то еще."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1063
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_8bf4ebd2:

    # "Something that drives me onwards, something from outside..."
    "Нечто, что движет мной дальше, нечто извне..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1064
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_90b93b6a:

    # "It's..."
    "Это..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1067
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_d1df3db6:

    # "Ice-cold water!"
    "Ледяная вода!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1073
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_bc5c4518:

    # DUPREY "{b}ON YOUR FEET, MAGGOT!{/b}"
    DUPREY "{b}НА НОГИ, ЧЕРВЬ!{/b}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1074
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_5ad11caa:

    # "Captain Duprey's heavy kick quickly stood me up straight, recent knockout echoing in my head with an irritating, pulsing pain."
    "Мощный удар капитана Дюпре быстро поставил меня на ноги, недавний нокаут отдавался в голове раздражающей, пульсирующей болью."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1075
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_e7a57264:

    # DUPREY "Go again, Demorai won't wait for you to come back to your senses!"
    DUPREY "Давай еще, Деморай не будет ждать, пока ты придёшь в себя!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1076
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_032e9f26:

    # MC "(Gotta get a grip...)"
    MC "(Нужно взять себя в руки...)"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1077
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_Training3Final_Lose_523ecf6e:

    # DUPREY @ angry "I'm trying to be nice to you maggot, now go again!"
    DUPREY @ angry "Я пытаюсь быть с тобой вежливым, червяк, теперь давай снова!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1089
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6a4925e0:

    # MARKUS "Gah! You sure know how to make it hurt!"
    MARKUS "Ах! Ты точно знаешь, как сделать больно!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1090
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fb6a986:

    # MC "{i}*Huff*{/i} Someone’s had to knock some sense into you!"
    MC "{i}*Гхах*{/i} Кто-то должен был вбить в тебя немного здравого смысла!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1091
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_66516ca5:

    # "As me and Markus caught our breath, I noticed an unusual figure dressed in fine fabrics speaking to the Captain."
    "Пока мы с Маркусом переводили дух, я заметил необычную фигуру в дорогих тканях, разговаривающую с Капитаном."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1092
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_163ee6d6:

    # "The Captain seemed unimpressed with whatever the man was saying and seemed to be refusing him something before being handed what seemed like a very official looking letter."
    "Капитан, казалось не был впечатлён тем, что говорил этот человек, и похоже отказывал ему в чём-то, пока ему не вручили то, что выглядело как очень официальное письмо."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1093
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_783e0863:

    # "I thought I could make out the royal seal."
    "Мне показалось, я разглядел королевскую печать."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1094
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_edb3c6df:

    # "I couldn’t hear what was being said, but I managed to figure out the words escaping his lips, {i}‘They’re not ready yet!’{/i}"
    "Я не мог расслышать, что говорилось, но мне удалось разобрать слова срывающиеся с его губ: {i}‘Они ещё не готовы!’{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1095
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7e66af39:

    # MARKUS "What’s going on?"
    MARKUS "Что происходит?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1096
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_28993885:

    # "I nudged him to look over towards Duprey."
    "Я толкнул его, чтобы он взглянул в сторону Дюпре."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1097
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_78c93499:

    # MARKUS "... Is that someone from the palace?"
    MARKUS "... Это кто-то из дворца?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1098
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_6da37e5e:

    # MC "I think so."
    MC "Думаю, да."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1099
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c390d19a:

    # MARKUS "Since when did the palace send its fancy officials down to us mud and grunts?"
    MARKUS "С каких это пор дворец отправляет своих нарядных чиновников к нам, в грязь и окопы?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1100
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d52535a2:

    # MARKUS "What do you think they want? It must be serious."
    MARKUS "Как думаешь, что им нужно? Должно быть, что-то серьёзное."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1101
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_67965d23:

    # MC "I don’t know... but I don’t think it’s going to be anything good."
    MC "Не знаю... но не думаю, что это будет что-то хорошее."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1106
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_452c6b58:

    # "All of a sudden, the Captain heaved himself reluctantly onto the wooden platform and cried out for our attention."
    "Внезапно Капитан неохотно взгромоздился на деревянную платформу и крикнул, привлекая наше внимание."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1107
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4074b31d:

    # DUPREY "FORM RANKS!"
    DUPREY "СТРОЙСЯ!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1109
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7bdc104e:

    # "The tired and weary Scouts hastily moved to form neat rows and face the Captain, hanging on his every word."
    "Уставшие и измождённые Разведчики поспешно выстроились в ровные ряды, повернувшись к Капитану и ловя каждое его слово."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1110
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d0187a8e:

    # DUPREY "We have been ordered on early leave for a mission."
    DUPREY "Нам приказали досрочно завершить подготовку для выполнения миссии."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1111
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_af5fac36:

    # "Confused mutterings swept through the ranks, as most of us expected the training to last for months."
    "По рядам пронесся недоуменный шёпот, поскольку большинство из нас ожидало, что обучение продлится ещё месяцы."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1112
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_41c2d6b4:

    # DUPREY "SILENCE!!!"
    DUPREY "ТИШИНА!!!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1113
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_219c5f53:

    # DUPREY "This order has come down from Emperor Alcott himself and has been approved by King Mesamor."
    DUPREY "Этот приказ исходит от самого Императора Алкотта и утверждён Королём Месамором."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1114
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b792546:

    # DUPREY "We leave come first light tomorrow."
    DUPREY "Мы выступаем на рассвете завтра."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1115
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0fa47cd9:

    # DUPREY "Get to bed early, make sure you’re well fed and be absolutely certain that your equipment is clean and ready."
    DUPREY "Ложитесь спать пораньше, убедитесь что вы сыты, и будьте абсолютно уверены что ваше снаряжение чисто и готово."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1116
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_cae6e8d4:

    # "A timid hand was raised from the crowd."
    "Из толпы робко поднялась рука."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1117
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_c2e2d792:

    # DUPREY "What is it?"
    DUPREY "Что такое?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1119
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_13b24539:

    # RECRUIT "Where are we to be sent, sir?"
    RECRUIT "Куда нас направляют, сэр?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1120
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_544b0d7d:

    # DUPREY "The mission is top secret, all I can tell you is that you will be recovering relics from a lost fortress south of here."
    DUPREY "Миссия совершенно секретна, всё что я могу сказать — вы будете извлекать реликвии из затерянной крепости к югу отсюда."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1121
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac7589b:

    # DUPREY "Expect at least six weeks march, take this into consideration with your prep."
    DUPREY "Ожидайте как минимум шестинедельный марш, учтите это при подготовке."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1122
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ee4f7f5b:

    # DUPREY "Dismissed!"
    DUPREY "Свободны!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1125
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cfa9b03:

    # "With that, the Captain stormed his way off stage, angrily shoving the sealed letter back into the fumbling hands of the palace official before stalking back to his quarters."
    "С этими словами Капитан гневно сошёл со сцены, грубо сунув запечатанное письмо обратно в дрожащие руки дворцового чиновника, после чего направился к своим покоям."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1126
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fa69c2ee:

    # "The men soon dissolved the ranks and the process of packing up for our departure began."
    "Вскоре ряды солдат распались, и начался процесс подготовки к нашему отбытию."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1132
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_73d9be9c:

    # "There was much confused chatter about what this {i}‘secret mission’{/i} entailed, and more so the worry of now being confronted by the Demorai so clearly unprepared."
    "Послышалась растерянная болтовня о том, что же включает в себя эта {i}«секретная миссия»{/i}, и ещё больше беспокойства по поводу столкновения с деморай в столь неподготовленном состоянии."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1133
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d33077f7:

    # MARKUS "What the fuck was all that about?"
    MARKUS "Какого хрена это вообще было?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1134
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_07f11245:

    # MC "I don’t know, looks like some higher up bullshit to me."
    MC "Не знаю, похоже на какую-то херню высшего начальства."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1135
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3e0ef9c5:

    # MC "Guess we'll be skipping the test then..."
    MC "Похоже, тест мы пропустим..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1136
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_52b2a82f:

    # MARKUS "Hm... I’ll make sure to pack some extra bread for you, okay?"
    MARKUS "Хм... Я позабочусь, чтобы упаковать для тебя дополнительный хлеб, ладно?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1137
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f6d7e7b6:

    # MC "Where’d you get the extra rations from, you fancy fuck?"
    MC "Откуда у тебя лишние пайки, пафосный ублюдок?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1138
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a1c732d3:

    # MARKUS "My brother sent it to me the other day, figured we could split it..."
    MARKUS "Мой брат прислал мне их на днях, подумал, поделимся..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1139
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ce4a9c8a:

    # MC "Oh, thank you."
    MC "Оу, спасибо."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1140
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_7ff3445a:

    # MARKUS "In return I want some of that sweet wine you got!"
    MARKUS "Взамен я хочу немного того сладкого вина, что у тебя есть!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1141
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_95e59f81:

    # MC "What?!"
    MC "Что?!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1143
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_282b2d00:

    # MARKUS "Hey! Don’t hold out on me! I know your dear sweet [regina_ref!t] brought you some!"
    MARKUS "Эй! Не скрывай это от меня! Я знаю что твоя милая [regina_ref!t] принесла тебе немного!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1143
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8b5596df:

    # MC "Alright, alright, {i}we’ll share.{/i}"
    MC "Ладно, ладно, {i}мы разделим.{/i}"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1144
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_31c038e0:

    # MARKUS "That’s more like it!"
    MARKUS "Вот это другое дело!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1145
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbd1034e:

    # MARKUS "Didn’t want to have to bust your balls the whole trip if I die of dehydration because you wouldn’t spare {i}‘a single drop’{/i} for your dearest and oldest friend!"
    MARKUS "Не хотелось бы мне всё путешествие пилить тебя, если я умру от обезвоживания, потому что ты не пожалел {i}‘ни капли’{/i} для своего самого дорогого и старого друга!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1146
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9f87cee2:

    # MC "But then how would I achieve my dream of becoming a drunk?"
    MC "Но тогда как я осуществлю свою мечту стать алкоголиком?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1147
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_957e6607:

    # MARKUS "I have every confidence that you’ll find a way, no matter what."
    MARKUS "Я абсолютно уверен, что ты найдёшь способ, несмотря ни на что."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1149
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a370dbb4:

    # "Suddenly, the ginger haired girl strutted over to us, a coy little smile on her face."
    "Внезапно рыжеволосая девушка подошла к нам, на её лице играла кокетливая улыбка."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1150
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d469bfc4:

    # KIARA "Looks like I’ve been partnered up with you two for the march."
    KIARA "Похоже, меня определили в пару к вами двоим на марш."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1151
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8cea643d:

    # MARKUS "Oh?"
    MARKUS "Ох?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1152
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5926d935:

    # KIARA @ happy "Aye, that won’t be a problem, will it?"
    KIARA @ happy "О да, это же не будет проблемой, верно?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1153
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f3de8e53:

    # MARKUS "After that little show you put on with the Captain when we first got here? It’ll be our pleasure."
    MARKUS "После того маленького представления что ты устроила с Капитаном, когда мы только прибыли? Это будет для нас удовольствием."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1154
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4e8676e6:

    # MARKUS "I’ll be sure to let you soften the Demorai up before I get there!"
    MARKUS "Я обязательно позволю тебе размягчить Деморай, прежде чем я прибуду!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1155
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0739d47d:

    # KIARA "How {i}valiant{/i} of you."
    KIARA "Как это по-{i}рыцарски{/i} с твоей стороны."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1157
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2cba1877:

    # "I caught her gaze and nodded:"
    "Я поймал её взгляд и кивнул:"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1158
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ae8a726e:

    # MC "Kiara."
    MC "Киара."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1159
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_107ca765:

    # "Kiara nodded and smiled mischievously."
    "Киара кивнула и лукаво улыбнулась."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1160
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_1b1ca23b:

    # KIARA "What do they call your cute friend here?"
    KIARA "Как зовут твоего милого друга здесь?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1161
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_435e4d75:

    # MARKUS "Hey! I can hear you!"
    MARKUS "Эй! Я всё слышу!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1162
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_217ebd58:

    # KIARA "I know, honey. So?"
    KIARA "Знаю, дорогой. И что?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1163
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_65cbbe79:

    # MARKUS "...It's Markus."
    MARKUS "...Я Маркус."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1164
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_246faf04:

    # KIARA @ happy "Well then, pleasure to meet you, Markus."
    KIARA @ happy "Что ж, приятно познакомиться, Маркус."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1165
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0757128a:

    # KIARA "I'll take the rear, is that alright with you guys?"
    KIARA "Я займу тыл, вас это устраивает?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1168
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_deaeaf6f:

    # MC "What’s your name?"
    MC "Как тебя зовут?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1169
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5e61be4f:

    # KIARA "Kiara, love."
    KIARA "Киара, милый."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1172
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_8ae7bf84:

    # "Kiara smiled and winked mischievously."
    "Киара улыбнулась и лукаво подмигнула."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1173
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a0467524:

    # KIARA "What do they call you cuties then?"
    KIARA "А как вас зовут, милашки?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1174
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f39a4545:

    # MARKUS "Oooh, did you hear that? She thinks we’re cute!"
    MARKUS "Ууу, слышал? Она считает нас милашками!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1175
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_e8544c91:

    # KIARA "Not when you speak, but I’ve seen worse looking."
    KIARA "Не когда ты говоришь, но я видела и пострашнее."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1176
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_d5d404a7:

    # KIARA "Even if you are pale as a ghost!"
    KIARA "Даже если ты бледный как призрак!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1177
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_fbeafcd2:

    # MARKUS "Hey!"
    MARKUS "Эй!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1179
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2c7fdf17:

    # MC "I’m [player_name!t]."
    MC "Я [player_name!t]."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1179
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_a74d1cac:

    # MARKUS "Markus."
    MARKUS "Маркус."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1180
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_e4d4b219:

    # MARKUS @ angry "And I ain’t no ghost!"
    MARKUS @ angry "И я не призрак!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1181
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_36300c92:

    # KIARA "Pleasure to meet you both, I’ll take the rear?"
    KIARA "Приятно познакомиться с вами обоими, я займу место в тылу?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1183
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_35e56202:

    # MC "I don’t see why not."
    MC "Не вижу причин отказывать."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1184
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f81a48ca:

    # KIARA "Thanks, makes a change from you always looking at {i}my{/i} rear."
    KIARA "Спасибо, это разнообразие после того, как ты постоянно смотришь на {i}мой{/i} тыл."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1185
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2accebc1:

    # MARKUS "Ha! She’s caught you out good!"
    MARKUS "Ха! Она тебя хорошо подловила!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1186
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_4fc8cb2c:

    # MC "I didn’t—"
    MC "Я не—"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1187
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_f0011b14:

    # KIARA "I didn’t say I was complaining!"
    KIARA "Я не говорила, что жалуюсь!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1188
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3b86159d:

    # KIARA "You can keep admiring all you like, you’re only human after all."
    KIARA "Можешь продолжать восхищаться сколько угодно, ты всего лишь человек."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1189
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_2a91684c:

    # "Markus grinned at me and laughed to himself as he saw how flustered I became."
    "Маркус усмехнулся и тихо рассмеялся, видя, как я смутился."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1190
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_42417170:

    # MC "... Hold on, how come you’ve been told to march with us?"
    MC "... Погоди, почему тебе приказали маршировать с нами?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1191
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_915dc432:

    # MC "I thought you were going to be further back down the line."
    MC "Я думал, ты будешь дальше в строю."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1192
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_65264838:

    # KIARA "I might have asked the commander to move me up next to you two..."
    KIARA "Возможно я попросила командира перевести меня поближе к вам двоим..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1193
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_5a08631f:

    # MC "Why?"
    MC "Зачем?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1195
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3f37e306:

    # MARKUS "Obviously because of my dazzling good looks, [player_name!t]!"
    MARKUS "Очевидно из-за моего ослепительно красивого вида, [player_name!t]!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1195
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_64e215fb:

    # KIARA "Keep lying to yourself if that’s what gets you through the day, love."
    KIARA "Продолжай обманывать себя, если это помогает тебе прожить день, милый."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1196
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_3b54ef92:

    # KIARA "The truth is... everyone’s seen you two fighting."
    KIARA "Правда в том... что все видели, как вы двое сражаетесь."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1197
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ac30842:

    # KIARA "You boys make a good team."
    KIARA "Вы парни, составляете хорошую команду."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1198
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_699eea4a:

    # KIARA "Better than most of this lot at least."
    KIARA "По крайней мере, лучше чем большинство из этой компании."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1199
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_673d1764:

    # KIARA "... Figured I’d stand a better chance of survival being partnered up with you two."
    KIARA "... Подумала, что у меня будет больше шансов выжить, если я объединюсь с вами двумя."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1200
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_48e47706:

    # KIARA "So, I asked, and the Captain agreed to move me up."
    KIARA "Так что я попросила, и Капитан согласился перевести меня."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1201
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_198af0fd:

    # KIARA "Any problems with that?"
    KIARA "Есть какие-то проблемы с этим?"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1202
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_04ca229b:

    # "Me and Markus looked at each other."
    "Мы с Маркусом переглянулись."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1203
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_54572fe2:

    # MC "Nope."
    MC "Нет."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1204
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9a84ee75:

    # MARKUS "I’m alright with it."
    MARKUS "Я не против."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1205
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_972b4bb1:

    # KIARA "Good, I’ll see you boys later then..."
    KIARA "Хорошо, тогда увидимся позже, парни..."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1209
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_0ce8ea7e:

    # "Kiara strutted off, presumably to pack her things for the excursion."
    "Киара гордо удалилась, предположительно, собирать вещи для вылазки."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1210
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_b2b7db2b:

    # "Markus smiled ruefully and whistled at me."
    "Маркус горько улыбнулся и присвистнул в мою сторону."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1211
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_9d49d3f6:

    # MARKUS "Well... someone’s got a fan!"
    MARKUS "Что ж... у кого-то появился поклонник!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1212
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_b3b45f2d:

    # MC "Ha-ha, something tells me that one’s gonna be trouble."
    MC "Ха-ха, что-то подсказывает мне, что эта будет проблемной."

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1213
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_ceb03dd5:

    # MARKUS "Trouble or not, if you don’t go for her, I sure as hell will!"
    MARKUS "Проблемной или нет, если ты не пойдёшь к ней, я чёрт возьми, точно пойду!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1214
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_cba5c2b3:

    # MC "Hey!"
    MC "Эй!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1215
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_013c78f1:

    # MARKUS "What? If I get a shot at getting laid again before dying, I’m taking it!"
    MARKUS "Что? Если у меня появится шанс переспать с кем-то перед смертью, я им воспользуюсь!"

# game/data/world_quests/main/Prologue/ForgedInFire/scr_ForgedInFire.rpy:1216
translate ru qst_ForgedInFire_FinalSparring_Complete_bc14e7e9:

    # MC "{i}*Sigh*{/i} Alright, alright, come on now, let’s get ready for this damn march..."
    MC "{i}*Вздох*{/i} Ладно, ладно, давай уже, готовься к этому чёртову маршу..."

